      {
        "id": 20376,
        "name": "Longshot",
        "username": "Longshot",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/longshot/{size}/1940_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-11-04T12:36:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi all! I took a look around this forum but couldn't seem to find an answer, so I had to make an account just to get some clarification in advance of me running the SCRPG for the first time tomorrow.</p>\n<p>In the Urban Infestation one-shot, referring to Myriad creating minions, his Release the Swarm ability says&nbsp;\"create [Max] minions of size [Min]\"</p>\n<p>If this is done, I assume the following results would be interpreted thus;</p>\n<p>Roll of d4=2, d6=3, d12=4* would create 4 minions of size d4</p>\n<p>Roll of d6=2,&nbsp;d12 = 3, d4=4 would create 4 minions of size d6</p>\n<p>Roll of d12=2, d6=3, d4=4 would create 4 minions of size d12</p>\n<p>OR would the [Max] refer to the smallest dice roll that could give that result, so a low-rolling [Max] with a d12 doesn't neccesarily mean the spawning of super-hardcore minions, and all the results above would give 4 minions of size d4? This lines up with Lieutenants having a \"value\" equal to the maximum size of their dice, double of which is the damage needed to remove them without a save.</p>\n<p>Thanks for the advice! I'm not sure it hugely matters as long as it's played consistently, but I am curious what the consensus is.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>*Of course, this dice pool was invented to illustrate the example</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:27.353Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 42,
        "reads": 2,
        "readers_count": 1,
        "score": 210.4,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 20375,
        "topic_slug": "max-and-min-in-dice-pools-refer-to-the-number-or-the-polyhedron",
        "display_username": "Longshot",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
